How to compile the project:
Type 'make'

Example of how to run the project:
./oss -n 3 -s 2 -t 4 -i 0.6

Options:
-n  total number of workers oss will launch
-s  max number of workers in the system at once (capped at 20)
-t  max simulated seconds a worker stays (each worker gets a random time up to t)
-i  minimum simulated seconds between launching workers 

